4. start-picking Contract

العقد الحالي Production/Current يحقق المطلوب:

Bearer token
      ↓
auth.getUser()
      ↓
users.auth_id = user.id
      ↓
public.users.company_id
      ↓
runsheets.company_id = company
      ↓
Open / Confirmed
      ↓
Picking
      ↓
picker_id = public.users.id

ولا يوجد في Current:

email fallback
automatic user creation
app_settings.limit(1)
post_stock_movement
reserve_stock

بل يوجد company-scoped lookup وconcurrency/idempotency handling.

